I came up with a tactic that worked well in my last ascension. Normally
when I pack up my stash for the run to the planes, I end up leaving behind
a lot of wands that had previously outlasted their usefulness. Particularly
wands of striking. This time I brought a bunch of them to the Astral and
then [a]pplied them to break them. Every monster that surrounded me got
pummeled (at least, when I finally got around to breaking a wand that
wasn't out of charges...d'oh!). So long as you are appropriate protected
yourself, striking, fire, lighting, cold all do pretty heavy damage to
everything in your immediate vicinity without hurting you at all. It's also
a pretty fast action, so I could do it a couple of times in a row between
counterattacks from the teeming hordes.



